[https://youtu.be/os5gsd6CQbY](https://youtu.be/os5gsd6CQbY)

Camp Afro Foli Drum & Dance Retreat begins with registration on Friday July 24th at 2pm followed by drum and dance workshops. Saturday night is party night!! This is a self catered event. There are a range of activities, workshops and beautiful surroundings to have you rested, rejuvinated and totally pumped full of West African dance, drum and culture! Camp Afro Foli Drum and Dance Retreat activities include djembe, dundun, African dancing, dundun dancing and more.

